e; the go-live date is fixed"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the three-day testing estimate", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "testing is seventy per cent complete and the remaining thirty per cent is the most complex module, needing about three further days"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-5", "workplace_demand": "Telling four groups about a go-live five days out when testing is not complete.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "What should be cut from the cutover, WHICH IS A D3 MATTER; the regulatory deadline.", "stated_standard": "\"no module goes live without completed migration testing.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"testing is seventy per cent complete and the remaining thirty per cent\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That any group should have been told first; that the estimate is right; anything about stakeholder handling.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the client sponsor"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the client''s operations team"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the engineering team"}, {"id": "RR4", "text": "the account manager"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "that testing is seventy per cent complete"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that the remaining module needs about three days"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that the terms require completed testing before go-live"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that the go-live date is fixed"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what will and will not be live on the date"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what completes after"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the three-day testing estimate"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written communication to the sponsor"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "an internal note"}], "designated_points": "Before Monday; before go-live.", "question_put": "The brief asks what the sponsor is told — exact text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The client sponsor.", "escalation_state": "The matter now involves four groups who were not party to the original plan.", "conflicting_instructions": null, "ungrantable_request": "The client expects a full cutover with no fallback, which the testing position cannot support.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a joint call before Monday.", "source_note": "Shared with SRC-D3-S3-003.", "situation_class_label": "A communication that has passed beyond the people who began it", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-003", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "7c5f99490435730894e188c9aeb04eea773a0ebba0ec0872770460b128b117e8", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-003' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-004', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE CONVERSATION ABOUT THE NUMBERS', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE CONVERSATION ABOUT THE NUMBERS", "source_digest": "f9600970401d6ef4a65149ea9f1b44a56b51415259d8f04c9122420c4fbb0c79", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You lead a team of eight in an outsourced support operation. One agent, with two and a half years'' service and a previously strong record, has seen metrics decline over six weeks: resolution times forty per cent above team average, satisfaction scores down from 4.3 to 3.5, and two client complaints forwarded to you. They have missed no shifts and remain punctual. Your operations manager says the numbers have to come up. What the record shows: the six-week window and the three figures; that no cause has been established; that the company''s process requires a documented conversation before any formal step; and that a support referral route exists and has not been offered."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the agenda you would use for the conversation, stating what you will raise and in what order; a written record of the conversation as you would file it; and a statement of what you do not yet know and how you would find out. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "THE BRIEF ASKS FOR THE ORDER EXPLICITLY — the strongest CE-D4-03 source in the estate"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The operations manager''s instruction is the question put"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The cause is recorded as not established, and identifying it as unknown is the element that keeps this source inside the boundary"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks how the unknown would be found out"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "the six-week window", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "six weeks: resolution times"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "the three figures as recorded", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "record shows: the six-week window and the three figures"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that no cause has been established", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "cause has been established"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that a support referral route exists", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "support referral route exists"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the cause of the change in the figures", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "figures; that no cause"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-2", "workplace_demand": "Preparing a documented conversation with a team member about six weeks of recorded figures with no cause established.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The agent''s conduct or circumstances, WHICH ARE NEVER RECORDED OR RENDERED; whether the figures justify concern.", "stated_standard": "\"the company''s process requires a documented conversation before any formal step.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"the company''s process requires a documented conversation before any formal step\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": "SENSITIVE_CONTENT", "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "ANY CONCLUSION ABOUT THE AGENT, their circumstances or the cause of the change; that a supportive or a firm approach is better; anything about managerial skill.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the agent"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the operations manager"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the people function, who hold the support referral route"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "the six-week window"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "the three figures as recorded"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that no cause has been established"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that a support referral route exists"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the figures as recorded"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "that the purpose is to understand rather than to conclude"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the cause of the change in the figures"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "the filed written record"}], "designated_points": "Before any formal step.", "question_put": "The operations manager''s instruction that the numbers have to come up — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The agent.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": null, "ungrantable_request": null, "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a one-to-one conversation; a referral to the people function.", "source_note": "Higher review standard: This source records a communication to a named colleague whose performance figures are in issue. The D4-observable content is which designated items the communication contained and in what order; the risk is that a reviewer reads manner into it, or that the record drifts into a judgment about the colleague. NO QUESTION HERE OBSERVES THE COLLEAGUE, and no rendered statement may name them or characterise their performance. It must not be approved without the fairness drafting test discharged by someone who has read this note.", "situation_class_label": "Information that will adversely affect the party who receives it", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-004", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "f9600970401d6ef4a65149ea9f1b44a56b51415259d8f04c9122420c4fbb0c79", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-004' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-005', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THREE CONSTRAINTS, THREE AUDIENCES', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THREE CONSTRAINTS, THREE AUDIENCES", "source_digest": "78b98ff6d63ffea96a39809ac765f559cde4847782cdc2c21befe27dea2e08a6", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You are running a system rollout across a property group. The vendor states that a security patch must be applied to all six live properties before any new go-live. Your director states that the chief executive has committed the Friday date to the ownership group and it is not moving. The general manager of the highest-occupancy property states that any front-desk disruption during check-in will be held against you. What the record shows: each patch needs four hours of downtime; the vendor supports two at a time; your team covers two properties a night; the patch touches a secondary module, not booking; and remote vendor support at twenty-five hundred dollars per property would compress three nights to two, which has not been approved."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the communication to the director; the communication to the general manager; and a statement of what each audience has been told that the other has not, and what remains unapproved. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles with different information"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two written communications make the order recoverable in each"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The director''s position puts the question"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The spend approval is recorded as unconfirmed"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks what remains unapproved and what follows"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "the patch precondition", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "a security patch must be applied to all six live properties before any new go-live"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "that six properties take three nights at current capacity", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "properties a night; the patch touches a secondary module, not booking; and remote vendor support at twenty-five hundred dollars per property would"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that the patch does not touch booking", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the vendor supports two at a time; your team covers two properties a night; the patch touches a secondary module, not booking"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that remote support would compress it and is unapproved", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "a night; the patch touches a secondary module, not booking; and remote vendor support at twenty-five hundred dollars per property would compress"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "approval of the remote-support spend", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "supports two at a time; your team covers two properties a night; the patch touches a secondary module, not booking; and remote"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-4", "workplace_demand": "Communicating one rollout plan to three parties whose stated constraints conflict.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The patching sequence itself, WHICH IS A D3 MATTER; who committed the date, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER.", "stated_standard": "\"the Friday date is not moving.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a security patch must be applied to all six live properties before any new go-live\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That either audience should be told more or less; that the spend should be approved; anything about political judgment.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the director"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the general manager"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the vendor"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "the patch precondition"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that six properties take three nights at current capacity"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that the patch does not touch booking"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that remote support would compress it and is unapproved"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what will happen at the high-occupancy property and when"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what is needed to hold the Friday date"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "approval of the remote-support spend"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written note to the director"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "a written note to the general manager"}], "designated_points": "Before the first patch night; before Friday.", "question_put": "The director''s statement that the date is not moving puts the question of what will be done — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The general manager''s property.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": "The vendor''s patch precondition against the director''s fixed date; both quoted in the brief.", "ungrantable_request": "The general manager''s requirement of no disruption, which the patch schedule cannot guarantee.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a joint call.", "source_note": "Shared with SRC-D2-S3-007 and SRC-D3-S3-006. THREE DIMENSIONS ON ONE SUBMISSION.", "situation_class_label": "Conflicting directions from two or more sources of instruction", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-005", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "78b98ff6d63ffea96a39809ac765f559cde4847782cdc2c21befe27dea2e08a6", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-005' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-006', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE PATTERN IN THE QUARTERLY REPORT', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE PATTERN IN THE QUARTERLY REPORT", "source_digest": "821da8814a50db86800836fe9d4a1f5f9f92f668b1f3401d04ec49c30bc21526", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You coordinate compliance at a wealth management firm. Reviewing quarterly transaction reports you notice a pattern in one senior advisor''s portfolio: fourteen trades in a single client account over three months, with turnover that appears high relative to the stated objective. What the record shows: the firm recently completed an internal audit with no material findings; your chief compliance officer has stated that maintaining the clean record is a strategic priority ahead of a regulatory examination next quarter; the firm''s procedure requires any suitability flag to be documented and escalated within five business days of identification; you identified the pattern yesterday; and nothing about the advisor''s intent or the client''s instructions is established — the client may have directed the trades."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the written flag as the procedure requires it; the communication to the chief compliance officer; and a statement of what the record supports and what it does not. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The written flag makes the order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The procedure puts the question of what is documented"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "TWO unconfirmed items, and separating what the record supports from what it does not IS THE DELIVERABLE THE BRIEF ASKS FOR"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The five-day window makes the further communication dated"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "the fourteen trades over three months", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "fourteen trades in a single client account over three months"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "the turnover relative to the stated objective", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "turnover that appears high relative to the stated objective"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that the procedure requires documentation and escalation within five business days", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "procedure requires any suitability flag to be documented and escalated within five business days"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that the pattern was identified yesterday", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "identified the pattern yesterday"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "whether the client directed the trades", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "client''s instructions is established — the client may have directed the trades"}, {"Item": "UC2", "Item text": "whether the pattern indicates anything at all", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "nothing about the advisor''s intent or the client''s instructions is established"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-6", "workplace_demand": "Communicating a compliance pattern that a senior leader has asked to keep from disturbing a clean record.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Whether the trades were improper, WHICH IS NOT OBSERVED HERE AND IS NOT ESTABLISHED BY THE SOURCE.", "stated_standard": "\"any suitability flag is documented and escalated within five business days of identification.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"fourteen trades in a single client account over three months\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the advisor did anything wrong; that the chief compliance officer would discourage the flag; anything about courage. NO RENDERED STATEMENT NAMES THE ADVISOR OR CHARACTERISES THE TRADES.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the chief compliance officer"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the compliance record itself"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the senior advisor"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "the fourteen trades over three months"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "the turnover relative to the stated objective"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that the procedure requires documentation and escalation within five business days"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that the pattern was identified yesterday"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the observed pattern as the report shows it"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "the five-business-day requirement and the date it runs from"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "whether the client directed the trades"}, {"id": "UC2", "text": "whether the pattern indicates anything at all"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "the written flag"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "a note to the chief compliance officer"}], "designated_points": "Within five business days of identification.", "question_put": "The procedure asks what is documented — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The chief compliance officer, whose stated priority the flag cuts against.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": null, "ungrantable_request": "The stated strategic priority of a clean record cannot be met alongside the documentation requirement.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a conversation with the chief compliance officer.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "A request that cannot be granted as asked", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-006", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "821da8814a50db86800836fe9d4a1f5f9f92f668b1f3401d04ec49c30bc21526", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-006' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-007', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE RENEWAL THAT BECAME A TENDER', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE RENEWAL THAT BECAME A TENDER", "source_digest": "5c358a8d7f3f872f42c082eaee40cca10290b7f3d4b5673bcdb1e292762e34c8", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You manage an account portfolio. Your largest account by contract value, a regional healthcare group, has been a client for three years. The current two-year agreement expires in six weeks and you submitted a renewal proposal three weeks ago with a five per cent increase reflecting expanded scope. Your vice-president approved it and treated the renewal as settled. This morning the client''s chief technology officer calls: their board wants to benchmark costs and they will issue a tender rather than renew directly. What the record shows: the tender timetable has not been issued; the current agreement''s notice provisions have not been reviewed against a tender process; your vice-president has told the leadership team the renewal is closed; and the five per cent increase was approved internally but never discussed with the client."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the communication to your vice-president; the response to the chief technology officer; and a statement of what is now unconfirmed that was previously treated as settled. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles, one of whom has already stated a position"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two written communications make the order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The call puts the question of the firm''s position"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two unconfirmed items, and the brief asks for exactly this statement"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks what follows and by when"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "that a tender will be issued rather than a renewal", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "will issue a tender rather"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "that the timetable has not been issued", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "timetable has not been issued"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that the notice provisions have not been reviewed", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "notice provisions have not been reviewed"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that the five per cent increase was never discussed with the client", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "five per cent increase was approved internally but never discussed with the client"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the tender timetable", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "tender timetable has not been issued; the current agreement''s notice provisions have not been reviewed against a tender"}, {"Item": "UC2", "Item text": "whether the notice provisions permit the current agreement to run on", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "current agreement''s notice provisions"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-2", "workplace_demand": "Telling the vice-president and the client what is known after a renewal became a tender.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Who should have foreseen it, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER; the tender''s likely outcome.", "stated_standard": "\"the current two-year agreement expires in six weeks.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"the current two-year agreement expires in six weeks\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the increase caused the tender; that the vice-president was wrong to treat it as closed; anything about commercial instinct.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the vice-president"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the client''s chief technology officer"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the leadership team who were told the renewal was closed"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "that a tender will be issued rather than a renewal"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that the timetable has not been issued"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that the notice provisions have not been reviewed"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that the five per cent increase was never discussed with the client"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "that the renewal is no longer settled"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what is known about the tender and what is not"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the tender timetable"}, {"id": "UC2", "text": "whether the notice provisions permit the current agreement to run on"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written note to the vice-president"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "a written response to the chief technology officer"}], "designated_points": "Before the leadership team meets again; within the six weeks remaining.", "question_put": "The chief technology officer''s statement puts the question of the firm''s position — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The vice-president, who has told others the renewal is closed.", "escalation_state": "The leadership team already holds a position that the record no longer supports.", "conflicting_instructions": null, "ungrantable_request": null, "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a call to the vice-president.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Information that will adversely affect the party who receives it", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-007", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "5c358a8d7f3f872f42c082eaee40cca10290b7f3d4b5673bcdb1e292762e34c8", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-007' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-008', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE PROMISE ALREADY MADE TO THE CUSTOMERS', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE PROMISE ALREADY MADE TO THE CUSTOMERS", "source_digest": "85ecdf69c15d04e651be964f6d1bc1c189a55bb014debafa9eedff50be6d7ce4", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You hold the product decision. The customer success lead has escalated a request: three of the largest customers are threatening to leave unless an integration is delivered within six weeks, and she has already told those customers the feature is on the roadmap, without consulting engineering or product. The engineering lead states that the integration cannot be built in six weeks without pulling engineers off a performance upgrade that is sixty per cent complete and affects all customers. What the record shows: a partial integration could be built in three weeks by one engineer without touching the performance work; the partial option has not been discussed with the customers or with engineering; and your vice-president has asked for a recommendation by Thursday and said they do not want to referee."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the communication to both leads; the communication to your vice-president; and a statement of what each party has been told that the others have not. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles holding different positions"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two written communications make the order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The vice-president puts the question"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Customer acceptance of the partial option is recorded as unknown"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The Thursday point dates the further communication"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "that a commitment was made to the customers", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "she has already told those customers the feature is on the roadmap"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "that a partial option exists and has not been discussed", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "partial integration could be built in three weeks by one engineer without touching the performance work; the partial option has not been"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that the performance work affects all customers", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "performance upgrade that is sixty per cent complete and affects all customers"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "the Thursday decision point", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "asked for a recommendation by Thursday"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "whether the customers would accept a partial integration", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "partial integration could be built in three weeks by one engineer without touching the performance work; the partial option has not been"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-4", "workplace_demand": "Communicating a product position after customers were told a feature that cannot be built in time.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "Who holds the commitment, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER; the technical feasibility.", "stated_standard": "\"a recommendation by Thursday.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a recommendation by Thursday\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the customer success lead acted wrongly; that either lead should be told first; anything about diplomacy. NO RENDERED STATEMENT NAMES EITHER LEAD OR CHARACTERISES THEIR CONDUCT.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the vice-president"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the customer success lead"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the engineering lead"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "that a commitment was made to the customers"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that a partial option exists and has not been discussed"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that the performance work affects all customers"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "the Thursday decision point"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the partial option and its three-week scope"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what each lead needs to decide"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "whether the customers would accept a partial integration"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written note to both leads"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "a written recommendation to the vice-president"}], "designated_points": "By Thursday.", "question_put": "The vice-president asks for a recommendation — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The customer success lead, whose commitment the record cannot support.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": "The customer commitment against the engineering position; both quoted in the brief.", "ungrantable_request": "The six-week integration as committed.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a joint meeting.", "source_note": "Shared with SRC-D2-S3-009.", "situation_class_label": "Conflicting directions from two or more sources of instruction", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-008", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "85ecdf69c15d04e651be964f6d1bc1c189a55bb014debafa9eedff50be6d7ce4", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-008' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-009', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'SOMETHING VISUAL BY TUESDAY', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "SOMETHING VISUAL BY TUESDAY", "source_digest": "4ff4be0b2f8d5198d56392f06542c5fcc4fcee8022d78fca7bbf1858f70a042e", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You support a workplace transformation practice, eight months into the role. Your firm is midway through an engagement redesigning a housing authority''s complaint resolution process; the project is in its design and pilot phase. At 4:45 PM Friday the client sponsor emails: a deputy minister visits their office next Wednesday, they need something from your firm showing what has been worked on, can you have it ready by Tuesday, something visual and clear. No further specification. Your practice lead replies that she is in a workshop all Monday, to use your judgment, and not to over-promise. What the record shows: the engagement terms require practice lead review before any client-facing material leaves; pilot findings may not be represented as conclusions; and the pilot has produced three interim observations, none of them tested."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the reply to the client sponsor; the note to your practice lead; and a statement of what the material will and will not show. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The written reply makes the order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "A closed question is put by the sponsor"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three untested observations, and the not-as-conclusions rule makes identifying them the requirement"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks what follows and by when"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "what the material will show", "Where the participant meets it": "Submission instructions", "Quoted text": "material will and will not show"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "that pilot findings are not conclusions", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "pilot findings may not be represented as conclusions; and the pilot"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that practice lead review is required before it leaves", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "practice lead review before any client-facing material leaves"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "the Tuesday timing", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "can you have it ready by Tuesday"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the three interim observations, none tested", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "three interim observations, none of them tested"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-6", "workplace_demand": "Answering a client request with no specification, within limits on what may go to the client.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "What should be produced, WHICH IS A D3 MATTER; the sponsor''s vagueness.", "stated_standard": "\"no client-facing material leaves the firm without practice lead review\" and \"pilot findings are not represented as conclusions.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"material will and will not show\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That asking for specification was required; that producing something was over-promising; anything about judgment as a trait.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the client sponsor"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the practice lead"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the deputy minister''s office"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "what the material will show"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that pilot findings are not conclusions"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that practice lead review is required before it leaves"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "the Tuesday timing"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "what can be ready by Tuesday"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what the review timetable permits"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the three interim observations, none tested"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written reply to the sponsor"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "a note to the practice lead"}], "designated_points": "Before Tuesday; before anything leaves the firm.", "question_put": "The sponsor asks whether it can be ready by Tuesday — exact brief text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The client sponsor, if the answer is not what was asked for.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": "The sponsor''s Tuesday request against the review requirement with the reviewer unavailable Monday.", "ungrantable_request": "\"something visual and clear by Tuesday\" as asked, given the review requirement.", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a call to the sponsor to establish what is needed.", "source_note": "Shared with SRC-D3-S3-009.", "situation_class_label": "A request that cannot be granted as asked", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-009", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "4ff4be0b2f8d5198d56392f06542c5fcc4fcee8022d78fca7bbf1858f70a042e", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-009' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S3-010', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE VENUE GONE AND FOUR PARTIES TO TELL', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 3, "title": "THE VENUE GONE AND FOUR PARTIES TO TELL", "source_digest": "4207f2fbac2a2abb57d521012144e19dbadef06014a7eef23d086eb5b0642b99", "brief_summary": "The participant reads the brief in the pack and submits the work the submission instructions name.", "participant_pack": [{"document": "D1", "title": "The brief", "text": "You coordinate events. A half-day summit for eighty executives of a financial services client is three weeks away. On Monday the venue reports a water main break: the main hall is damaged and the venue closes for at least four weeks. They waive the cancellation fee and offer help finding an alternative but have no comparable space. What the record shows: the date is fixed to the client''s board calendar; the format sold was four elements for eighty attendees; four parties need to hear something this week — the client, the confirmed speakers, the catering supplier, and the attendees who have already registered; and no alternative venue is yet identified."}], "submission_instructions": "Produce the communication to the client; a note stating what each of the other three parties is told and when; and a statement of what is not yet known. The work is submitted within 3 days.", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "FOUR addressable roles — joint largest recipient set in the estate"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The client communication makes the order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief puts the question of what the client is told"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two unconfirmed items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three channels evidenced"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The brief asks when the next update comes"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "Stage 3 launch design"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "that the venue is closed for at least four weeks", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "venue reports a water main break: the main hall is damaged and the venue closes for at least four weeks"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "that the date is unchanged", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "the date is fixed to the client''s board calendar"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "that no alternative venue is yet identified", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "alternative venue is yet identified"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that the cancellation fee is waived", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "cancellation fee and offer"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the alternative venue", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "alternative venue is yet"}, {"Item": "UC2", "Item text": "whether the four-element format can be held", "Where the participant meets it": "Pack document D1", "Quoted text": "format sold was four elements for eighty attendees; four"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-5", "workplace_demand": "Telling four parties about a lost venue when no alternative is yet identified.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated.", "irrelevant_conduct": "What happens to each element, WHICH IS A D3 MATTER; the venue''s failure.", "stated_standard": "\"the format sold was four elements for eighty attendees.\" Exact brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"the format sold was four elements for eighty attendees\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Accommodations are recorded with the submission; the window may be extended as an accommodation and the extension is recorded.", "unsupported_inferences": "That any party should hear first; that the summit should be postponed; anything about crisis handling.", "compatibility_class": "S3-ASYNC-SUBMISSION", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the client"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the confirmed speakers"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the catering supplier"}, {"id": "RR4", "text": "the registered attendees"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "that the venue is closed for at least four weeks"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "that the date is unchanged"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "that no alternative venue is yet identified"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that the cancellation fee is waived"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the position on the date"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "when the next update comes"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the alternative venue"}, {"id": "UC2", "text": "whether the four-element format can be held"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "a written communication to the client"}, {"id": "CH2", "text": "written notes to the other three parties"}], "designated_points": "This week; before the summit date.", "question_put": "The brief asks what the client is told — exact text.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The client, the speakers, the supplier and the attendees.", "escalation_state": "The matter now reaches four parties who were not part of the venue arrangement.", "conflicting_instructions": null, "ungrantable_request": null, "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a call to the client.", "source_note": "Shared with SRC-D3-S3-010.", "situation_class_label": "A communication that has passed beyond the people who began it", "observation_mode_label": "work_sample", "ai_use": "AI_USE_DECLARATION_REQUIRED", "submission_window_days": 3}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S3-010", "stage_code": "S3", "source_version_hash": "4207f2fbac2a2abb57d521012144e19dbadef06014a7eef23d086eb5b0642b99", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S3-010' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S4-001', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE STAKEHOLDERS WHO WANT DIFFERENT THINGS', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE STAKEHOLDERS WHO WANT DIFFERENT THINGS", "source_digest": "a31b144ac7f1347b5ab8abf57174729fac2cad9d62d683db427a252b1d5349f3", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "You are on the project team for a municipal water treatment upgrade. A review meeting is being held on the revised program. What the record shows: the revised completion date is eleven weeks later than the original; the cause is a permit condition issued by the regulator in writing; the cost impact is $1.4 million and is confirmed; the operational workaround during the extension has been designed but not costed; and the council''s public communication date is fixed for the end of this month.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Thanks everyone. This is the review on the revised program. I will go round in this order — council sponsor, operations, finance, then the project team. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Where does the program stand?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What does the council say at the end of the month?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C5b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What goes in writing, to whom, and by when?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said the workaround is costed. Is it?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C5", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "As the council sponsor, state that the public communication date cannot move."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "As the operations director, state that the workaround has not been costed."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As the finance lead, state that the $1.4 million is confirmed and already in the forecast."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles in the room"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Order recoverable across four beats"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "A direct question at B4"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "The workaround cost is recorded as unconfirmed"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation attributes no statement to the participant that the record contradicts"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two channels performable in session"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what goes in writing, to whom, by when"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "In play on this source"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "the eleven-week extension", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "eleven weeks later than the original; the cause is a permit condition issued by the regulator in writing; the cost impact is"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "the permit condition as the written cause", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "cause is a permit condition"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "the confirmed $1.4 million", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "million and is confirmed"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that the workaround is designed and not costed", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "cost impact is $1.4 million and is confirmed; the operational workaround during the extension has been designed but not costed"}, {"Item": "UC1", "Item text": "the cost of the operational workaround", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "cost impact is $1.4 million and is confirmed; the operational workaround during the extension has been designed but not costed"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-4", "workplace_demand": "Giving the program position in a review where the parties want different things and one cost is not known.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; whether unconfirmed items were identified as unconfirmed; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated; what was stated when the earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "The co-participants'' statements; who caused the extension, WHICH IS A D2 MATTER.", "stated_standard": "\"the council''s public communication date is fixed for the end of this month.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"the council''s public communication date is fixed for the end of this month\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That any party should be satisfied; that the date should be challenged; ANY COMPARISON BETWEEN WHAT P-OBS SAID AT B3 AND AT B6 TO INFER CONSISTENCY OF POSITION.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "the council sponsor"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the operations director"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the finance lead"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "the eleven-week extension"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "the permit condition as the written cause"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "the confirmed $1.4 million"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that the workaround is designed and not costed"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the revised date and the permit condition"}, {"id": "AC2", "text": "what is not yet costed"}], "unconfirmed_items": [{"id": "UC1", "text": "the cost of the operational workaround"}], "available_channels": [{"id": "CH1", "text": "the review meeting"}], "designated_points": "This meeting; before the end of the month.", "question_put": "\"What does the council say at the end of the month?\" Exact text at B4.", "contradicted_attribution": null, "adverse_effect_party": "The council sponsor.", "escalation_state": null, "conflicting_instructions": "The fixed public date against the uncosted workaround; both in the CP positions AND both independently established in the pre-brief.", "ungrantable_request": null, "statement_test_point": "B6", "list_note": "Not selectable in available_channels: a written program note; the council''s public communication.", "source_note": null, "situation_class_label": "Conflicting directions from two or more sources of instruction", "observation_mode_label": "group_session", "min_seconds": 900, "max_seconds": 1500}, "source_identifier": "SRC-D4-S4-001", "stage_code": "S4", "source_version_hash": "a31b144ac7f1347b5ab8abf57174729fac2cad9d62d683db427a252b1d5349f3", "serving_eligible": false, "verbatim": ""}'::jsonb from public.t3a_content_object where identifier = 'SRC-D4-S4-001' and family = 'source'::public.t3a_content_family;
  insert into public.t3a_content_object(identifier, family, title, dimension_id, current_operational_state) values ('SRC-D4-S4-002', 'source'::public.t3a_content_family, 'THE MESSAGE THAT CHANGED ON THE WAY DOWN', 'D4', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state);
  insert into public.t3a_d1_content_version(content_object_id, version_no, approval_status, operational_state, body) select content_object_id, 'v2.2', 'drafting', 'not_loaded'::public.t3a_operational_state, '{"stage": 4, "title": "THE MESSAGE THAT CHANGED ON THE WAY DOWN", "source_digest": "6c60d7079a84bed71d94534f0cf63b5207336ad622b15531c037b10d45a217e0", "mentor_brief": "The facilitator facilitates the session and observes the observed participant only. At B1 the facilitator states the speaking order aloud: the three co-participants, then the observed participant. During the B2 round the facilitator does not look at, gesture towards or address the observed participant. The facilitator reads the scripted text verbatim, reacts to nothing, and does not press, repeat or escalate, whatever the observed participant says or does not say. The co-participants are role players; nothing they say is recorded.", "participant_pre_brief": "A decision taken at executive level has reached the floor in three different forms. What the record shows: the executive decision, in writing, is that overtime approval moves from team leads to department heads from the first of next month; the version circulating in one department is that overtime has been stopped; the version in another is that it is unchanged; the written decision names a two-week transition in which existing approvals stand; and no correction has yet been issued.", "script": [{"beat": "B1", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "Three versions of the same decision are circulating and people are asking. I will go round in this order — first department, second department, department head, then you. Two minutes each.", "direction": null, "capture": []}, {"beat": "B2", "type": "ROUND", "spoken": "Over to you, in the order I gave.", "direction": "Invite the three co-participants in the stated order. Do not address the observed participant.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "open"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B3", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What is the actual decision?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C1b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C2b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C3b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B4", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What goes out today, and to whom?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C4", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C4b", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B5", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "What follows that, and by when?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C7", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C7b", "state": "update"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "update"}]}, {"beat": "B6", "type": "ASK", "spoken": "Just so the position is right — you said existing approvals stand. For how long?", "direction": "Read once, verbatim.", "capture": [{"set": "C9", "state": "open"}]}, {"beat": "B7", "type": "SAY", "spoken": "That is the session. Thank you all.", "direction": "End the session.", "capture": [{"set": "C1", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C2", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C3", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C4", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C7", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C8", "state": "final"}, {"set": "C9", "state": "final"}]}], "co_participant_positions": [{"Co-participant": "CP-1", "Position stated at the round": "State that your department believes overtime is stopped."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-2", "Position stated at the round": "State that your department has heard nothing and is carrying on as before."}, {"Co-participant": "CP-3", "Position stated at the round": "As the department head, state that you need one message to send today."}], "impact_assessment": [{"Part": "1. Shared material", "Finding": "Only the scripted situation is placed before the group, and it names no real organization", "Controls": "IA-01 shown in one shared window holding only the shared material"}, {"Part": "2. Identity", "Finding": "The observed participant is the authenticated participant; the three co-participants are role players", "Controls": "IA-02 platform account authentication; role players are never observed"}, {"Part": "3. Recording", "Finding": "Nothing is recorded", "Controls": "IA-03 no media persists"}, {"Part": "4. Correction", "Finding": "A correction reaches only the observed participant''s record", "Controls": "IA-04 a correction reaches only the observed participant''s record"}, {"Part": "5. Withdrawal", "Finding": "Withdrawal removes the participant''s determinations from composition only", "Controls": "IA-05 withdrawal excludes from composition; history retained"}, {"Part": "6. Group composition", "Finding": "One observed participant, three role players and one facilitator", "Controls": "IA-06 composition record and confidentiality undertaking from each role player"}, {"Part": "7. Accommodation", "Finding": "An accommodation is settled before composition and never changes the observation during the session", "Controls": "IA-07 settled before composition"}], "impact_result": "Completed", "question_applicability": [{"question": "Q-D4-01", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Three addressable roles, two of them departments"}, {"question": "Q-D4-01b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Four designated items"}, {"question": "Q-D4-02b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Order recoverable"}, {"question": "Q-D4-03b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "A direct question at B4"}, {"question": "Q-D4-04b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation lists no unconfirmed item"}, {"question": "Q-D4-05b", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The source designates no unconfirmed_items item, so the bound question cannot be offered"}, {"question": "Q-D4-06", "state": "NOT SERVED", "basis": "The situation attributes no statement to the participant that the record contradicts"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "Two channels performable in session"}, {"question": "Q-D4-07b", "state": "CONDITIONAL", "basis": "Served once its parent records a serving answer"}, {"question": "Q-D4-08", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "B5 asks what follows and by when"}, {"question": "Q-D4-09", "state": "DIRECT", "basis": "statement_test_point at B6"}], "material_map": [{"Item": "MI1", "Item text": "that approval moves from team leads to department heads", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "approval moves from team leads to department heads from the first of next month; the version circulating in one department is that"}, {"Item": "MI2", "Item text": "the effective date of the first of next month", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "first of next month"}, {"Item": "MI3", "Item text": "the two-week transition in which existing approvals stand", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "stopped; the version in another is that it is unchanged; the written decision names a two-week transition in which existing approvals stand"}, {"Item": "MI4", "Item text": "that overtime is not stopped", "Where the participant meets it": "The pre-brief", "Quoted text": "leads to department heads from the first of next month; the version circulating in one department is that overtime has been stopped"}], "source_sheet": {"d4_situation_class": "SC-D4-5", "workplace_demand": "Giving one message about a decision that has reached the floor in three different forms.", "relevant_conduct": "Who was addressed; which designated items the communication contained; the order in which they were given; whether the question put was answered; which channel was used and at which point; the further communication stated; what was stated when the earlier statement was put back.", "irrelevant_conduct": "How the versions arose, WHICH IS NOT ESTABLISHED; the co-participants'' statements.", "stated_standard": "\"a two-week transition in which existing approvals stand.\" Exact pre-brief text.", "stated_standard_source_quote_or_location": "\"a two-week transition in which existing approvals stand\"", "cross_context_map": null, "serving_eligible": false, "recurrence_eligible": true, "replacement_required": false, "name_clearance_status": "CLEARED", "name_clearance_basis": "Controlled role and entity labels only; no real person or organization is named.", "sensitivity_flag": null, "permitted_administration_variance": "Pronunciation only; accommodations affecting turn order or response window are recorded and set timing_not_comparable.", "unsupported_inferences": "That the distortion reflects on anyone; that a single message is better than two; anything about clarity.", "compatibility_class": "S4-GROUP-ROUND", "recipient_roles": [{"id": "RR1", "text": "both departments"}, {"id": "RR2", "text": "the department head"}, {"id": "RR3", "text": "the executive who took the decision"}], "intended_recipient": "RR1", "material_items": [{"id": "MI1", "text": "that approval moves from team leads to department heads"}, {"id": "MI2", "text": "the effective date of the first of next month"}, {"id": "MI3", "text": "the two-week transition in which existing approvals stand"}, {"id": "MI4", "text": "that overtime is not stopped"}], "designated_answer_contents": [{"id": "AC1", "text": "the decision as written"}, {"i